scn 1
# legion_cost scaling fixture (tools/legion_cost.py): N movers (footprint 2)
# cross an open map to one click. tools/legion_cost.py rewrites only the COUNT
# of group A (100 here; it runs 100/200/400); the spawn rect holds 400 bodies at
# pitch=3, so no other line changes with N. One selection over 64 commands
# lands over consecutive ticks and makes several Legion groups, as in play.
# legion_cost steady 200 1000
name cost-open
ticks 2000
# The gate offsets (W3 round 4, ruling (a)): -5 spawns group A off the map, so +6 in its place.
gateoffsets 0,1,-1,2,-2,3,-3,4,-4,5,6
seed 7
map flat 192 140
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.8
group A 0 m 100 rect 4 20 52 120 pitch=3
at 1 move A 160 70
region goal 140 50 180 90
